# Copy this file. Change the name. Fill it in.
# Comments and blank lines are ignored, so you can leave them.
#
# The checker will refuse the file unless every claim has three things,
# and it will tell you which one is missing:
#
#     when      where does this hold?  A person is not one thing everywhere.
#     because   what did you actually SEE?  Not what you concluded.
#     on        when did you learn it?  You will not remember otherwise.
#
# "observed" means you saw it.  "inferred" means you worked it out.
# The difference is the whole point -- a year from now this file will tell
# you which of the two you are actually good at.

remember Someone

    role            colleague
    also known as   "S"
    met             2026-01
    currently       between projects

    observed qw1
        when      leaving the room
        because   picking up helmet,asfd
        on        2026-02-11

    observed fc1
        when      dfdsfa
        because   adfsas
        on        2026-02-11
#    inferred dislikes being interrupted
#        when      mid-sentence, with other people in the room
#        because   stopped talking and never picked the thread back up
#        on        2026-03-04

end
